e do not have prior experience;","context":"•","section":"Item 1A. Risk Factors","block":210,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001193125-26-059853","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-02-20","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001136869","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1136869/000119312526059853/zbh-20251231.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/8fc41a84a1b9a79d5301e03d9977525ef286332e5df172feb536aa0ad6355d79.bin","sha256":"8fc41a84a1b9a79d5301e03d9977525ef286332e5df172feb536aa0ad6355d79"}},{"id":"4db4546d24217de917cbb4d4a31972c6e3a8451221828b637e1b769e86819f9a","quote":"potential loss of key employees and key third parties;","context":"•","section":"Item 1A. Risk Factors","block":212,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001193125-26-059853","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-02-20","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001136869","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1136869/000119312526059853/zbh-20251231.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/8fc41a84a1b9a79d5301e03d9977525ef286332e5df172feb536aa0ad6355d79.bin","sha256":"8fc41a84a1b9a79d5301e03d9977525ef286332e5df172feb536aa0ad6355d79"}},{"id":"1ea9e3beefccea0a11b5058bbd169167a80ae0064e30d8e12a6138437a4753dd","quote":"unforeseen risks and liabilities associated with businesses acquired, including any unknown vulnerabilities in acquired technology, compromises of acquired data or noncompliance with laws and regulations; and/or","context":"•","section":"Item 1A. Risk Factors","block":214,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001193125-26-059853","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-02-20","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001136869","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1136869/000119312526059853/zbh-20251231.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/8fc41a84a1b9a79d5301